# AIRE Requirements Steward — drift-tracking configuration
# Bootstrapped by aire-drift Phase 0 on 2026-10-21. Review, edit if needed, commit, then re-run aire-drift.

# Source: canonical AIRE path. docs/requirements.md has no "## Sources" / "## References" section, so no linked PRDs were added.
requirements-sources:
  - docs/requirements.md

# Source: docs/status.md Project Overview "Active Cycle: CYCLE-1" → docs/plans/builds/cycle-1
active-cycle: docs/plans/builds/cycle-1

# Source: git rev-parse --abbrev-ref @{u} on branch main → origin/main
active-base: origin/main

# Source: first 10 lines of docs/requirements.md start with "# Requirements - ..." (no "---" or "<!--" prefix),
# so neither yaml nor html-comment was detected. Heading-anchored diffing (v1 default) applies.
frontmatter-format: none
